{"total": 60, "lines": [{"i": 0, "text": "পুরোনো electronics আলাদা করুন। তারপর BhangariWala-তে pickup request দিন—শুরু হবে দায়িত্বশীল e-waste journey।", "s": 1.29, "e": 8.75}, {"i": 1, "text": "BhangariWala team আপনার দরজা থেকে e-waste সংগ্রহ করে নিরাপদ ও সংগঠিতভাবে পরবর্তী ধাপে নিয়ে যায়।", "s": 11.41, "e": 18.0}, {"i": 2, "text": "সংগ্রহের পর e-waste category অনুযায়ী আলাদা করা হয়—device, battery, cable, circuit board এবং অন্যান্য components।", "s": 21.13, "e": 29.28}, {"i": 3, "text": "Data-containing device আলাদা করে secure handling-এর আওতায় নেওয়া হয়, কারণ পুরোনো device-এর data-ও গুরুত্বপূর্ণ।", "s": 31.49, "e": 38.15}, {"i": 4, "text": "Device খুলে metal, plastic, battery, circuit board ও অন্যান্য components আলাদা করা হয়—যাতে recoverable resource পুনরায় কাজে লাগানো যায়।", "s": 40.66, "e": 49.85}, {"i": 5, "text": "এইভাবেই পুরোনো electronics দায়িত্বশীল recycling journey-তে যায়—কমে waste, ফিরে আসে resource, সুরক্ষিত থাকে পরিবেশ।", "s": 51.03, "e": 59.24}], "words": [{"w": "পুরোনো", "s": 1.29, "e": 1.69, "line": 0}, {"w": "electronics", "s": 1.69, "e": 2.36, "line": 0}, {"w": "আলাদা", "s": 2.36, "e": 2.88, "line": 0}, {"w": "করুন।", "s": 2.88, "e": 3.54, "line": 0}, {"w": "তারপর", "s": 3.54, "e": 3.88, "line": 0}, {"w": "BhangariWala-তে", "s": 3.88, "e": 4.78, "line": 0}, {"w": "pickup", "s": 4.78, "e": 5.09, "line": 0}, {"w": "request", "s": 5.09, "e": 5.65, "line": 0}, {"w": "দিন", "s": 5.65, "e": 6.2, "line": 0}, {"w": "শুরু", "s": 6.2, "e": 6.48, "line": 0}, {"w": "হবে", "s": 6.48, "e": 6.76, "line": 0}, {"w": "দায়িত্বশীল", "s": 6.76, "e": 7.6, "line": 0}, {"w": "e-waste", "s": 7.6, "e": 8.26, "line": 0}, {"w": "journey।", "s": 8.26, "e": 8.75, "line": 0}, {"w": "BhangariWala", "s": 11.41, "e": 12.01, "line": 1}, {"w": "team", "s": 12.01, "e": 12.31, "line": 1}, {"w": "আপনার", "s": 12.31, "e": 12.75, "line": 1}, {"w": "দরজা", "s": 12.75, "e": 12.93, "line": 1}, {"w": "থেকে", "s": 12.93, "e": 13.36, "line": 1}, {"w": "e-waste", "s": 13.36, "e": 13.9